        },
        {
          "text": "Ni mwumve iri jambo, yemwe mwa mahogazi y’i Bashani, muba ku musozi Samariya, yemwe abahahaza abagorwa, mukavungavunga abakene, mukabarira abanega banyu, muti Ni muzane tunywe! ",
